        "rawMarkdown": "this too falls under sparse annotations i think\n\n> Annotations are sparse \u2014 not every cell in every frame is labeled.\n\nand we can't reconstruct the entire embryo either",
        "content": "<p>this too falls under sparse annotations i think</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Annotations are sparse \u2014 not every cell in every frame is labeled.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>and we can't reconstruct the entire embryo either</p>",
